WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.380
- So wait, I have to
talk to you about this

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:05.340
because bonus songs on the
25th inspired by album.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.680
Like this, you only got these songs...

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.270
There are songs that you had
recorded like in your life,

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.190
or not recorded, but like just played.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.023
- Yeah.

00:00:12.023 --> 00:00:13.860
- And there were fans
that actually recorded

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.300
because you didn't remember them.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.133
- Yeah.

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:17.490
- And you actually found
a fan you would go to.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.990
Is his name Allen?
- Yeah.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.470
- This is the most incredible
story. Tell everybody.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.980
- (laughs) So I've always been prolific,

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.330
but I've never written anything down.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.130
And so I'd lose songs all the time.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.170
And so it was the dawn of the internet.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.760
So I'd get on there on some list serve.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.980
I'd be like, "Does anybody
have a song called "Jessica"

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.040
that I sang once at a cafe in Toronto?"

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.690
And this guy would always write back

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.040
and go, "Yeah, I have that bootleg."

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.320
And, "Yes, I have that one"
and, "Yes, I have that one."

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.150
I was like, "Do you want a job?"

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.530
So I ended up hiring him.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.940
He is worked for me since like '94-

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:45.990
- That's incredible!

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.997
- Or something like that. (laughs)

